          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji BWANA wawona angu Lea ndekundo ukam'bonya upate wana, ela Raheli orekoghe kolowi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea ukapata kifu, ukava mwana wa womi, ukammbanga irina jake Reubeni; angu oreghambieghe, “Loli BWANA waghuzighana wasi ghwapo, idana mumi wapo uchanikunda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukapata kifu sena, ukava mwana wa womi, nao ukaghamba, “Kwa kukaia BWANA wawona angu sikundo, niko wanineka uhu mwana wa womi sena.” Nao ukammbanga irina jake Simeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukapata kifu chimu sena, ukava mwana wa womi ukaghamba, “Idana mumi wapo uchawadana na ini, angu namvaia wana wa womi wadadu.” Kwa huwu irina jake orewangiloghe Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukapata kifu sena, ukava mwana wa womi, nao ukaghamba, “Ngelo ihi nichamkasa BWANA.” Kwa huwu ukammbanga irina jake Juda; nao ukaleka kuva.",
          "type": "text",
